{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在上方第一组大号白字和金色强调词“憋着一股气”“当作自己人”，随后容易被下方同样醒目的大号白字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人心里憋着气，想起曾经有人把自己当作自己人，但完整处境不够明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、有气；短暂高兴，情绪有矛盾感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方第二组文字表达的情绪转折：高兴还没消退就转为心酸，以及旧日子回不去、离开后是否真的会更好的疑问。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两组大字都很突出，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块大字中，需要结合阅读才能理解从短暂高兴到心酸的情绪转折。\",\n    \"上方单块句子较长，包含原本憋着气、回忆被接纳、短暂高兴几个层次。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5000be3-1bc4-4a50-8491-8f5b2e289c96", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012049602056Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:21:11.223520+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7f347b06064dfd263452758b5e2edb6b9a2e81db38c42bdb0795a0c6aab40de5", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3